From fecd8560a3d8f5989e280bbed06f3426d5dcafa9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Docwright <patch@docwright.local>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 01:06:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: text preview log, pause/stop/resume controls, and
 status indicators

- VoiceOverPage: add Pause and Stop buttons shown while generation is in progress
- VoiceOverPage: button label shows 'Resume generation' when an unfinished run is resumable
- VoiceOverPage: add missing CSS for .voice-state-* status indicator classes
- VoiceOverPage: add missing CSS for .voice-script-* text preview log card
- VoiceOverPage: add .voice-control-actions CSS for the new buttons
- TalkingHeadPage: add .th-state status indicator showing current stage, progress counters,
  saved chunk count badge, resumable badge, and done checkmark
- TalkingHeadPage: add text-preview log card showing every line that will be sent to the
  voice model before processing begins
- TalkingHeadPage: add Pause / Stop buttons shown while in progress
- TalkingHeadPage: wire up controlTalkingHead() for pause/stop/resume via existing API
- TalkingHeadPage: button label shows 'Resume generation' when hasUnfinishedGeneration is true
- TalkingHeadPage: progress counters (audio clips, video segments, chunks) fed from
  status.progress returned by the existing /talking-head/status endpoint
---
